{"description":"Enjoy the incredible privilege of living in a 300m2 villa in the Passy district, in the heart of Paris, just a stone's throw from the Eiffel Tower. Very spacious, comfortable and warm, this property features 5 bedrooms and 5 bathrooms, an interior garden, a jacuzzi and sauna, a home cinema room... Luxury and voluptuousness are the watchwords of this exceptional residence, offering a calm and perfectly secure setting. You will feel at home from the very first moment.Other things to noteWe would like to point out that the house has air conditioning, but only on the top floor. It does, however, cool the floors below. Otherwise, we are equipped with fans. There is a separate toilet on each floor except the ground floor. There are showers in every room. The master bedroom has a bath and a shower next to it. And another bedroom has a bathtub with a shower inside.","amenities":[{"title":"Private hot tub","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Kitchen","available":true,"subtitle":"Space where guests can cook their own meals"},{"title":"Wifi","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Dedicated workspace","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"TV","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Free washer – In unit","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Central air conditioning","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Cooking basics","available":true,"subtitle":"Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper"},{"title":"Crockery and cutlery","available":true,"subtitle":"Bowls, chopsticks, plates, cups, etc."},{"title":"Portable heater","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Bath","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Hot water","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Free washer – In unit","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Hangers","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Bed linen","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Cinema","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"TV","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Sound system","available":tr